00:25:11.388 --> 00:25:14.792
COLLEAGUES, TODAY WE HONORED THE LIFE OF SUNSET RESIDENT JIM

00:25:14.792 --> 00:25:20.792
GARCIA JR A PROUD SAN FRANCISCAN WHO PASSED AWAY ON

00:25:21.998 --> 00:25:25.736
APRIL 15TH AT THE AGE OF 61 AFTER A LONG AND COURAGEOUS

00:25:25.736 --> 00:25:27.137
BATTLE WITH CANCER, JIM WAS DEEPLY ROOTED IN THE SUNSET.

00:25:27.137 --> 00:25:31.408
HE GREW UP IN THE NEIGHBORHOOD ATTENDING SAINTS OF CELIA

00:25:31.408 --> 00:25:34.879
AND ST IGNATIUS AND LATER WENT ON TO THE UNIVERSITY OF SAN

00:25:34.879 --> 00:25:38.282
FRANCISCO WHERE HE PLAYED DIVISION ONE TENNIS AND WAS

00:25:38.282 --> 00:25:39.349
AMONG THE TOP PLAYERS ON HIS TEAM.

00:25:39.349 --> 00:25:42.219
HIS LOVE FOR SPORTS STAYED WITH HIM THROUGHOUT HIS LIFE.

00:25:42.219 --> 00:25:45.956
HE PLAYED IN LOCAL SOFTBALL GAMES FOR MORE THAN 20 YEARS

00:25:45.956 --> 00:25:49.560
AND GAVE BACK AS A COACH AT SAINT CECILIA MENTORING

00:25:49.560 --> 00:25:51.280
GENERATIONS OF YOUNG PEOPLE INCLUDING HIS OWN CHILDREN.

00:25:51.280 --> 00:25:54.707
AS A GENERAL CONTRACTOR, JIM HELPED BUILD HOMES ACROSS THE

00:25:54.707 --> 00:25:57.978
SUNSET AND THROUGHOUT SAN FRANCISCO INCLUDING THE HOME

00:25:57.978 --> 00:26:01.248
WHERE HE RAISED HIS FAMILY. HE TOOK PRIDE NOT ONLY IN THE

00:26:01.248 --> 00:26:05.118
STRUCTURES HE BUILT BUT IN THE PEOPLE HE TAUGHT ALONG THE WAY.

00:26:05.118 --> 00:26:08.187
HE SHARED HIS SKILLS GENEROUSLY TRAINING WITH YOUNG WORKERS

00:26:08.187 --> 00:26:09.256
AND WORKING SIDE BY SIDE WITH HIS SON.

00:26:09.256 --> 00:26:12.526
FOR JIM IT WAS NEVER JUST ABOUT THE WORK.

00:26:12.526 --> 00:26:15.796
IT WAS ABOUT BUILDING SOMETHING LASTING AND BRINGING OTHERS

00:26:15.796 --> 00:26:17.130
ALONG WITH HIM. MANY IN THE COMMUNITY ALSO KNEW

00:26:17.130 --> 00:26:20.801
JIM THROUGH HIS PASSION FOR CARS FOR MEET UPS ALONG THE

00:26:20.801 --> 00:26:24.470
GREAT HIGHWAY TO GATHERINGS AT SPEEDWAY MEADOW.

00:26:24.470 --> 00:26:27.941
HE BROUGHT PEOPLE TOGETHER HIS LOVE FOR MEL PERS ESPECIALLY

00:26:27.941 --> 00:26:31.541
HIS RED ROAD RUNNER WAS UNMISTAKABLE.

00:26:32.145 --> 00:26:33.880
IT WAS NOT JUST A HOBBY IT WAS THE WAY HE CONNECTED WITH

00:26:33.880 --> 00:26:36.149
OTHERS AND BUILT LASTING RELATIONSHIPS.

